</report>

<report type:"WARNING">
  description : "GOOG-16-013300 - Google Android 16 must disable screen capture."
  info        : "The screen capture feature could lead to the exposure of sensitive DOD information.

SFR ID: FMT_MOF_EXT.1.2 #47

NOTE: Nessus has not performed this check. Please review the benchmark to ensure target compliance."
  solution    : "Install a configuration profile to disable screen capture.

